Molecular Prior Network evaluation scripts for FS-Mol / ADKF-IFT
================================================================

Apply to the ADKF-IFT repository (https://github.com/Wenlin-Chen/ADKF-IFT)
at commit b82497e1382e4edd821d1c6132d080035b456884:

    git clone https://github.com/Wenlin-Chen/ADKF-IFT.git
    cd ADKF-IFT
    git checkout b82497e1382e4edd821d1c6132d080035b456884
    git apply /path/to/adkf-ift.patch

The evaluation scripts additionally require the molpriornet package:

    pip install git+https://github.com/daltontx/molpriornet.git

Generated with:

    git diff b82497e1382e4edd821d1c6132d080035b456884 HEAD -- . ':(exclude)uv.lock'

The uv.lock file from our environment is omitted for readability; resolve
dependencies from pyproject.toml instead.

